  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9001.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9001.01 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to all breath alcohol procedures using the Intoxilyzer 9000 instrument for persons submitting to a breath test.\n\nSource. #12556, eff 6-21-18",
